      "physical behavior": "The straight walls constrain lateral translation of an inserted mating component, while the rounded corners prevent interference with corner radii and reduce local stress concentration. The closed internal loop distributes contact and handling loads around the full aperture.",
      "geometry": "A continuous rounded-rectangular inner sidewall composed of four planar straight spans joined by four cylindrical corner patches. The wall is inclined through the frame thickness in the model coordinate system.",
